H6.857V1.714h13.714Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="https://kick.com/propovcs2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Kick" title="Kick"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"&gt;&lt;path fill="currentColor" d="M1.333 0h8v5.333H12V2.667h2.667V0h8v8H20v2.667h-2.667v2.666H20V16h2.667v8h-8v-2.667H12v-2.666H9.333V24h-8Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>CV</title><link>https://jparedesds.com/en/cv/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>jparedescolmenarejo@gmail.com (Jose Paredes)</author><guid>https://jparedesds.com/en/cv/</guid><description>&lt;header class="cvHead"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h1&gt;CV&lt;/h1&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a class="cvDownload" href="https://jparedesds.com/resume.pdf" download aria-label="Download the PDF CV"&gt;&lt;svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"&gt;&lt;path fill="currentColor" d="M5 20h14v-2H5v2zm7-18v12.17l4.59-4.58L18 10l-7 7-7-7 1.41-1.41L11 14.17V2z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; PDF&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/header&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="cvCard"&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;h3 id="contact-information"&gt;Contact Information&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;table class="cvFacts"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Name&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Jose Paredes Colmenarejo&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Professional title&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Computer Vision &amp;amp; ML Engineer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/table&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="cvCard"&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;h3 id="experience"&gt;Experience&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="cvEntry"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvWhen"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024 — Now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Madrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvBody"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;Data Analyst &amp;amp; AI Engineer&lt;/h4&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h5&gt;EIPSA&lt;/h5&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Computer vision, data automation and AI-assisted product development for industrial engineering.&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;ul&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;li&gt;Architected DocFlow, an internal SaaS in production: 21 API routers, 24 service layers and 24 frontend screens, with DocuSign, JWT and Docker + CI.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;li&gt;Built and deployed YOLO11 detectors for fluorescent penetrant and welding defect inspection; published 10+ models on Hugging Face.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;li&gt;DXF technical-drawing extraction: 80% less manual processing time.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;li&gt;Email→ERP automation: 500+ incoming documents per month.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;li&gt;Document control for ISO 9001:2015, ATEX and IECEx certification workflows.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;li&gt;Tableau dashboards for project documentation tracking across international clients.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/ul&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="cvEntry"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvWhen"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2022&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Madrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvBody"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;Freelance Data Analyst&lt;/h4&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h5&gt;Freelance&lt;/h5&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Prepared and cleaned data for a SQLite database with a Flask visualisation layer, including category and level rankings for CrossFit competitions.&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="cvEntry"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvWhen"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2021 — 2023&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Madrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvBody"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;Data Management Technician&lt;/h4&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h5&gt;Comunicación Permanente&lt;/h5&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Customer database of 10,000+ records; managed technical incidents and emergencies; internal reporting improved incident tracking by 25%.&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="cvEntry"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvWhen"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2015 — 2020&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Madrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;div class="cvBody"&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h4&gt;Electronics Lab Technician&lt;/h4&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;h5&gt;Grupo ANOVO&lt;/h5&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;p&gt;Diagnostics and repair of 50+ consumer devices per week, at 95%+ quality; production data and quality metrics.&lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Privacy</title><link>https://jparedesds.com/en/privacy/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>jparedescolmenarejo@gmail.com (Jose Paredes)</author><guid>https://jparedesds.com/en/privacy/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This site is a personal portfolio run by &lt;strong&gt;Jose Paredes&lt;/strong&gt;, based in Madrid, Spain. It has no accounts, no comments and no newsletter, and no data is sold. This page explains what is collected when you visit, why, and how to opt out.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="google-analytics-only-with-your-consent"&gt;Google Analytics (only with your consent)&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The site uses Google Analytics 4 (measurement ID &lt;code&gt;G-Y85VJ3E6W4&lt;/code&gt;) to understand how the site is used: which pages are read, how visitors arrive and which content is useful. The legal basis is your consent: the analytics script loads &lt;strong&gt;only after you accept&lt;/strong&gt; the cookie banner. If you decline, it never loads.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Projects</title><link>https://jparedesds.com/en/projects/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>jparedescolmenarejo@gmail.com (Jose Paredes)</author><guid>https://jparedesds.com/en/projects/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Nine projects, each with an image, a short explanation and its links. Everything here is live or in production.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectGallery"&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;Industrial computer vision&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;YOLO11 detectors for fluorescent penetrant indications and welding defects, published as 10+ models on Hugging Face and used in real inspection work.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;YOLO11&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hugging Face&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Production&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://huggingface.co/jparedesDS/fluorescent-penetrant-inspection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Penetrant model&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://huggingface.co/jparedesDS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;More models&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/jparedesDS/welding-defects-detection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Welding detector&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/case-vision.svg" alt="Diagram of the industrial vision pipeline: camera frames, labelled dataset, YOLO11 and inspection." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;DocFlow — document control&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Internal SaaS built end to end: a FastAPI backend with 21 routers and 24 services, a React frontend with 24 screens, DocuSign signatures and Docker + CI deployment. The public repository is DocFlow Lite.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;FastAPI&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;React&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;DocuSign&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Docker&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/jparedesDS/docflow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;DocFlow Lite on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/case-docflow.svg" alt="DocFlow architecture: email and the ERP connected to FastAPI, React and DocuSign, deployed with Docker and CI." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;subany.video — subtitles in the browser&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Live subtitles processed locally with Whisper, Silero VAD and ONNX/WebGPU, with no servers. Fixed 15.3 s delay and a median subtitle offset of 0–40 ms.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Whisper&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Silero VAD&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;WebGPU&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://subany.video/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Open subany.video&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://subany.site/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;subany.site&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://jparedesds.com/en/blog/2026/11/09/how-subany-video-works/"&gt;How it works&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/case-subany.png" alt="The subany.video home page with the field for pasting a stream link to watch it subtitled." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;CleanYourPhone&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Reversible Android debloat without root: disables system apps and lets you restore the device to its original state.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Android&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No root&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cleanyourphone.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Open CleanYourPhone&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/cleanyourphone-thumb.png" alt="The CleanYourPhone interface listing the system apps that can be disabled." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;CleanYourMail&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Reversible inbox cleanup: organises and removes old messages without losing the thread of a conversation.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Email&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Python&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cleanyourmail.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Open CleanYourMail&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/cleanyourmail-thumb.png" alt="The CleanYourMail screen with the inbox summary and cleanup options." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;Pro POV CS2&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Autonomous esports content pipeline for Counter-Strike 2: clips, summaries and publishing across social networks.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;CS2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Esports&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://propovcs2.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Open Pro POV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@propov_cs2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/propov-cs2.png" alt="The Pro POV CS2 cover with its logo and examples of Counter-Strike 2 clips." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;HLTV Team &amp;amp; Player Stats Scraper&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Scraping and analysis of CS2 team and player statistics from HLTV.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Python&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scraping&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CS2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/jparedesDS/hltv-scraper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Code on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/myhltv.png" alt="A sample of the CS2 statistics table extracted by the HLTV scraper." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;Technical Drawing Data Extraction&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Deep learning to identify entities in DXF technical drawings and automate their documentation.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Deep Learning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;DXF&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;OCR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/jparedesDS/extract-data-dxf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Code on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/mydxf.png" alt="A DXF technical drawing with the detected entities highlighted." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="projectRow"&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="projectBody"&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;CS2 Weapon Detection&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Detector for 19 classes of weapons in Counter-Strike 2 with YOLO12m and a model published on Hugging Face.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul class="projectChips"&gt;&lt;li&gt;YOLO12m&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CS2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hugging Face&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p class="projectLinks"&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/jparedesDS/cs2-yolo12m-weapon-detection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Code on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://huggingface.co/jparedesDS/cs2-yolo12m-weapon-detection" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Model on Hugging Face&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://jparedesds.com/images/ocr-identification.png" alt="A Counter-Strike 2 capture with weapon names detected using OCR." width="320" height="180" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Repositories</title><link>https://jparedesds.com/en/repositories/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>jparedescolmenarejo@gmail.com (Jose Paredes)</author><guid>https://jparedesds.com/en/repositories/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>